# Capsule: Go Browser Development Kit

## Summary

4-phase learning path for clawbrowser-core: chromedp basics → CDP protocol → ARIA snapshots → CLI wrapper

## Usage Triggers

- User wants to build browser automation tool
- User asks about Go + Chrome development
- User needs ARIA snapshot implementation
- User wants CLI tool for web scraping

## Core Knowledge Points

### Phase 1: chromedp Basics

| Function | Purpose | Example |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `chromedp.NewContext()` | 啟動瀏覽器 | `ctx := chromedp.NewContext(...)` |
| `chromedp.Navigate()` | 頁面導航 | `chromedp.Navigate("https://example.com")` |
| `chromedp.Click()` | 元素點擊 | `chromedp.Click("#button")` |
| `chromedp.SendKeys()` | 表單填寫 | `chromedp.SendKeys("#input", "text")` |
| `chromedp.Screenshot()` | 截圖 | `chromedp.Screenshot("page.png", &buf)` |
| `chromedp.Text()` | 文本提取 | `chromedp.Text("body", &text)` |

**Practice:**
- ✅ 打開網頁並截圖
- ✅ 填寫表單並提交
- ✅ 提取頁面文本

### Phase 2: CDP Protocol

| Domain | Command | Purpose |
|--------|---------|---------|
| **DOM** | `QuerySelector` | 元素定位 |
| **Page** | `Navigate` | 頁面控制 |
| **Runtime** | `Evaluate` | JS 執行 |
| **Accessibility** | `GetFullAXTree` | ARIA 樹 |

**Practice:**
- ✅ 直接調用 CDP 命令
- ✅ 解析 DOM 樹
- ✅ 執行 JavaScript

### Phase 3: ARIA Snapshot

| Step | Code | Output |
|------|------|--------|
| 獲取 AXTree | `cdpaccessibility.GetFullAXTree().Do(ctx)` | `tree` |
| 解析節點 | `for _, node := range tree.Nodes` | `role, name, state` |
| 生成 Refs | `generateRefs(nodes)` | `@e1, @e2, @e3...` |
| 序列化 | `Snapshot{Refs, Nodes}` | JSON/Markdown |

**Practice:**
- ✅ 生成簡單快照
- ✅ 添加 Ref 標記
- ✅ 格式化輸出

### Phase 4: CLI Wrapper

| Component | Library | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|---------|
| 命令解析 | `cobra` | CLI framework |
| 配置管理 | `viper` | Config management |
| 錯誤處理 | `fmt.Errorf` | Error wrapping |
| 編譯 | `go build` | Binary output |

**Practice:**
- ✅ 實現 `open`, `click`, `screenshot` 命令
- ✅ 添加錯誤處理和重試
- ✅ 編譯並測試

## Knowledge Templates

### Template 1: Browser Launch

```go
package main

import (
    "context"
    "github.com/chromedp/chromedp"
)

func main() {
    opts := chromedp.DefaultExecAllocatorOptions[:]
    allocCtx, _ := chromedp.NewExecAllocator(context.Background(), opts...)
    ctx, _ := chromedp.NewContext(allocCtx)
    
    chromedp.Run(ctx, chromedp.Navigate("https://example.com"))
}
```

### Template 2: Page Operations

```go
var buf []byte
chromedp.Run(ctx,
    chromedp.Navigate("https://example.com"),
    chromedp.Click("#button"),
    chromedp.FullScreenshot(&buf, 90),
)
os.WriteFile("page.png", buf, 0644)
```

### Template 3: ARIA Snapshot

```go
import "github.com/chromedp/cdproto/cdpaccessibility"

func GenerateSnapshot(ctx context.Context) (string, error) {
    tree, err := cdpaccessibility.GetFullAXTree().Do(ctx)
    if err != nil {
        return "", err
    }
    
    refs := generateRefs(tree.Nodes)
    return serialize(refs), nil
}

func generateRefs(nodes []*AXNode) string {
    // @e1, @e2, @e3...
}
```

### Template 4: CLI Commands

```go
import "github.com/spf13/cobra"

var rootCmd = &cobra.Command{
    Use:   "clawbrowser",
    Short: "Browser automation tool",
}

var openCmd = &cobra.Command{
    Use:   "open <url>",
    Args:  cobra.ExactArgs(1),
    Run: func(cmd *cobra.Command, args []string) {
        browser.Open(args[0])
    },
}

func main() {
    rootCmd.AddCommand(openCmd)
    rootCmd.Execute()
}
```

## Core Code Patterns

### 1. Browser Launch
```go
opts := chromedp.DefaultExecAllocatorOptions[:]
allocCtx, _ := chromedp.NewExecAllocator(context.Background(), opts...)
ctx, _ := chromedp.NewContext(allocCtx)
```

### 2. Page Operations
```go
chromedp.Run(ctx,
    chromedp.Navigate(url),
    chromedp.Click(selector),
    chromedp.Screenshot(path, &buf),
)
```

### 3. ARIA Snapshot
```go
tree, _ := cdpaccessibility.GetFullAXTree().Do(ctx)
refs := generateRefs(tree.Nodes)
```

### 4. CLI Commands
```go
rootCmd.AddCommand(openCmd, clickCmd, screenshotCmd)
rootCmd.Execute()
```

## Application Examples

### Example 1: Simple Screenshot
```bash
go get github.com/chromedp/chromedp
```
```go
var buf []byte
chromedp.Run(ctx,
    chromedp.Navigate("https://example.com"),
    chromedp.FullScreenshot(&buf, 90),
)
os.WriteFile("page.png", buf, 0644)
```

### Example 2: Form Automation
```go
chromedp.Run(ctx,
    chromedp.SendKeys("#username", "user"),
    chromedp.SendKeys("#password", "pass"),
    chromedp.Click("#submit"),
)
```

### Example 3: Text Extraction
```go
var text string
chromedp.Run(ctx,
    chromedp.Text("body", &text),
)
fmt.Println(text)
```

